                                "sense_id": "99376552-804a-3731-81c7-1fb0856843da",
                                "text": "Lou Reed, lead singer of the Velvet Underground, veteran chronicler of life's wilder, seamier and more desperate side and one of the most influential and distinctive songwriters of his generation has died at the age of 71."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2292a059-835c-40a3-a680-12b6ee757341",
                                "sense_id": "99376552-804a-3731-81c7-1fb0856843da",
                                "text": "1987, David Brin, The Uplift War, Phantasia Press\nShe just hadn't been aware, having considered such tales rather seamy while growing up."
                            }
